<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka two-year bond yields unchanged.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka two-year bond yields unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction for two-year treasury bonds worth 500 million rupees with a coupon rate of 12.75 percent per annum held on Friday was oversubscribed, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>Bids received totalled 1.45 billion rupees.</p>
<p>	 Amount offered:	500 million rupees</p>
<p>	 Bids received:	 1.45 billion rupees</p>
<p>	 Amount accepted:     500 million rupees</p>
<p>	 Weighted avg yield:  12.75 percent per year (current)</p>
<p>				    12.75 percent (previous)</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
